  "text": "NISSAN | Inquiry Form of Nissan IR Inquiry Form of Nissan IR This form is a portal to receive IR inquiries from shareholders and investors. Please note that non-IR-related inquiries will not be responded. Before contacting via this form, please read the \"Privacy Policy\" and \"Handling of Personal Information\" carefully and check the box below for your confirmation. For your reference, please also refer to the \"Frequently Asked Questions\" . Select profile Required -- Please select -- Individual shareholders Institutional investors (Equities) Institutional investors (Bonds) Others Select item Required -- Please select -- Request for an interview Questions about business/performance Others - Frequently Asked Questions - Dividend Policy - Shareholders Meeting Select item Required -- Please select -- Dividends Shareholders Meeting Questions about business/performance - Frequently Asked Questions - Please note that we may not be able to respond to your inquiry depending on its content. Additionally, inquiries received during our holidays, such as year-end and New Year's holidays or summer vacations, may result in delayed responses. - If you do not provide accurate personal information and/or in the event of a system failure, we may not be able to reply. - Our responses are intended solely for the individual shareholders or investors who made the inquiry. Any reproduction or secondary use of all or part of our response is strictly prohibited. - Please be aware that we cannot accept replies to our response emails. * Please do not use this form for any sales promotion purpose. * \"Required\" fields is mandatory to be filled in. Company name Required Department name Full name Required E-mail address Required Shareholder ID Details of Inquiry Required - Privacy Policy/Handling of Personal Information - Disclosure Policy Agree TOP Inquiry Form of Nissan IR Our Company Stories Sustainability Investors Our Brands Innovation Home Sitemap Terms of use Website Privacy Notice Website Cookies Policy Disclaimer",
